00:04:20,575 --> 00:04:48,527
This is a 10-step, 10-page step. Now, combine the geometric clues we checked earlier into one. From the correspondence between shapes, we can confirm that the conclusion that the bisectors of the three interior angles we were trying to prove meet at one point (incenter I), and that the vertical distances from the incenter to all three sides are the same (radius r of the inscribed circle) are inevitably established.

